  "description": "Ever since they first met when he was seventeen, and right up until now, at twenty-two, Mun-Gyeol has had a secret crush on his friend Do-Ije, who is the same age as him. Even though he wouldn’t dare dream of confessing his feelings for fear that Do-Ije might feel betrayed if he found out, Mun-Gyeol ends up staying at Do-Ije’s house after a problem arises with his own apartment.\n\n*“Can I just sleep in the study?”\n\n“The study? You’re going to sleep with me, aren’t you?”*\n\nUnaware of Mun-Gyeol’s feelings, Do-Ije suggests they sleep in the same bed, as if he were an animal longing for human warmth… As if warning him not to get close to other humans, Do-Ije coats Mun-Gyeol’s body thoroughly with his mysterious pheromones.\n\n *“I’m in heat.”\n\n“H-heat?”*\n\nWhen his heat sets in, Do-Ije stimulates instincts that Mun-Gyeol finds nearly impossible to resist.\n\n *“I want to fuck you.”*\n\nJust what is the meaning behind his actions?\n\n(Source: Ribibooks, translated)",
